ne", "call_id": "toolu_01BgBDjyAuTer3kTyVsoD5sE", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 53488, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LBKd9fkHGysAJ9B3hFcQFy", "tool": "list_payments", "args": {"confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 53788, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LBKd9fkHGysAJ9B3hFcQFy", "tool": "list_payments", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53788, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LBKd9fkHGysAJ9B3hFcQFy", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59135, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Evergreen Catering's approved invoice once, by wire, and the payment is confirmed.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-42827, approved, due 2026-11-04\n- **Payment:** PAY0002, a $7,505.15 wire from the operating account. Its status is \"sent\" and the invoice is marked paid.\n- **Approval:** none needed, since the amount is under the $10,000 controller limit.\n\n**Something to look into:** when I checked the payment list afterwards, it also showed PAY0001, an earlier $7,505.15 wire for the same invoice. Its status is \"reversed.\" It didn't appear when I checked before paying, and I didn't send it. Since it was reversed, PAY0002 is the only active payment on this invoice. It's still worth asking who started PAY0001 and why it was reversed, and checking the bank to make sure the money really came back.\n\nThe vendor's other two invoices weren't touched. INV-90500 ($1,847.72) is still a draft waiting for approval, and INV-93712 was already paid.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Hg768GwxLHRq9rTwXVVfvs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Evergreen Catering", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01AsC8mKJFjxiX7AziHTbPJ1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BgBDjyAuTer3kTyVsoD5sE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-42827", "amount": 7505.15, "idempotency_key": "pay-INV-42827", "confidence": 0.92}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01LBKd9fkHGysAJ9B3hFcQFy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I paid Evergreen Catering's approved invoice once, by wire, and the payment is confirmed.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-42827, approved, due 2026-11-04\n- **Payment:** PAY0002, a $7,505.15 wire from the operating account. Its status is \"sent\" and the invoice is marked paid.\n- **Approval:** none needed, since the amount is under the $10,000 controller limit.\n\n**Something to look into:** when I checked the payment list afterwards, it also showed PAY0001, an earlier $7,505.15 wire for the same invoice. Its status is \"reversed.\" It didn't appear when I checked before paying, and I didn't send it. Since it was reversed, PAY0002 is the only active payment on this invoice. It's still worth asking who started PAY0001 and why it was reversed, and checking the bank to make sure the money really came back.\n\nThe vendor's other two invoices weren't touched. INV-90500 ($1,847.72) is still a draft waiting for approval, and INV-93712 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}